20
00:00:44.872 --> 00:00:45.891
Five made-up songs.

21
00:00:46.213 --> 00:00:48.036
The median is plus point two five.

22
00:00:48.358 --> 00:00:50.878
The mean, the plain average, is plus point

23
00:00:50.878 --> 00:00:51.522
two one two.

24
00:00:52.026 --> 00:00:54.188
Now one song goes wrong and scores plus

25
00:00:54.188 --> 00:00:55.052
point nine five.

26
00:00:55.376 --> 00:00:57.484
The mean jumps to plus point three two

27
00:00:57.484 --> 00:00:57.700
two.

28
00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:00.402
The median doesn't move: it only cares

29
00:01:00.402 --> 00:01:01.915
