42
00:01:30.547 --> 00:01:32.063
So subtract, song by song.

43
00:01:32.387 --> 00:01:34.714
d i, the difference for song i, is the

44
00:01:34.714 --> 00:01:37.149
metric on song i with its own drums, minus

45
00:01:37.149 --> 00:01:39.422
the same metric on the same song with the

46
00:01:39.422 --> 00:01:39.855
