51
00:01:48.773 --> 00:01:49.391
A real case.

52
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:51.913
Two LSTM drummers, one trained on thirty

53
00:01:51.913 --> 00:01:54.126
percent of the data, one on all of it,

54
00:01:54.126 --> 00:01:56.184
scored on the same eighteen hundred and

55
00:01:56.184 --> 00:01:57.008
forty-two songs.

56
00:01:57.317 --> 00:01:59.530
A song that's hard for one is usually hard

57
00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:00.250
